# Testing

- Prefer focused unit tests for domain/use-case/repository changes.
- Prefer fakes over broad mocks when testing ViewModels and repositories.
- For ViewModels, test state transitions and one-time events.
- For Compose screens, cover high-value interactions and empty/loading/error states when feasible.
- For migration-only moves, run compile/smoke tasks and avoid changing logic in the same patch.
- Use the narrowest relevant command while iterating:

```bash
./gradlew :composeApp:testDebugUnitTest
./gradlew :composeApp:compileDebugKotlinAndroid
./gradlew :androidApp:assembleDebug
```

